<title>UK: CSFB leads 100 mln mark Ecuador-linked bond.</title>
<headline>CSFB leads 100 mln mark Ecuador-linked bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Credit Suisse First Boston.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ECUADOR SYNTHETIC SOVEREIGN INVESTMENT JERSEY LTD</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON     *14.25    MATURITY   *16.MAR.15</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-DOWN ISS PRICE  101.0     PAY DATE  S-07.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.50	REOFFER    99.75     S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> NOTES	*TO MARCH 2000, THEN 10.25 PCT IF NOT CALLED</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    1.25	SELL CONC   1.25</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
